<article class="rw-panel"><h2>Saldo rekening & pembanding jurnal</h2>
    <div class="rw-balance"><?php foreach(['opening'=>'Saldo awal','in'=>'+ Seluruh kas masuk','out'=>'- Seluruh kas keluar','closing'=>'= Saldo akhir'] as $key=>$label): ?><div><span><?= $label ?></span><strong><?= $money($bt[$key]) ?></strong></div><?php endforeach ?></div><p>Saldo buku mengikuti rekening dan mata uang, bukan filter kategori, arah, pencarian, kelompok arus, atau hari rincian. Termasuk transfer dan pembalik. Bukan saldo bank terverifikasi.</p>
    <div class="rw-table-wrap"><table class="rw-summary-table"><thead><tr><th>Rekening</th><th>Awal</th><th>Masuk</th><th>Keluar</th><th>Akhir</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($r['balances']['rows'] as $a): ?><tr><td><?= $esc($a['account_name']) ?></td><?php foreach(['opening','in','out','closing'] as $key): ?><td class="rw-num"><?= $money($a[$key]) ?></td><?php endforeach ?></tr><?php endforeach ?></tbody></table></div>
    <?php if($accounting): ?><div class="rw-balance"><?php foreach(['income'=>'Pendapatan terjurnal','expense'=>'Beban terjurnal','profit'=>'Laba / rugi terjurnal'] as $key=>$label): ?><div><span><?= $label ?></span><strong>Rp <?= $money($accounting['sum'][$key]) ?></strong></div><?php endforeach ?></div><p><?= (int)$accounting['pending'] ?> mutasi sampai akhir periode belum dijurnal. Seluruh jurnal IDR bulan fokus, tidak mengikuti filter kas.</p><?php foreach($accounting['warnings'] as $warning): ?><p><?= $esc($warning) ?></p><?php endforeach ?><?php elseif($accounting_error): ?><p><?= $esc($accounting_error) ?></p><?php endif ?>
    <?php if($can_accounting): ?><a class="rw-button" href="<?= $esc(site_url('finance-reports/accounting').'?'.http_build_query(['tab'=>'profit','month'=>$f['month']])) ?>">Buka laba-rugi & jurnal</a><?php endif ?>
</article>
